{"path":"string/basic_string/starts_with","title":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::starts_with","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>starts_with","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string/starts_with","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if the string begins with the given prefix. The prefix may be one of the following:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; starts_with<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1254\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string_view</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT,Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> sv <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; starts_with<span class=\"br0\">(</span> CharT ch <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; starts_with<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> CharT<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> s <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if the string begins with the given prefix. The prefix may be one of the following:\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> A string view <code>sv</code> (which may be a result of implicit conversion from another <code>std::basic_string</code>).</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> A single character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> A null-terminated character string <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">s</span></code>.</div>\n<p>All three overloads effectively return <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1254\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string_view</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>data<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">starts_with</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, where <code>x</code> is the parameter.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> sv\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a string view which may be a result of implicit conversion from another <code>std::basic_string</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ch\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a single character\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> s\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a null-terminated character string\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the string begins with the provided prefix, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_starts_ends_with\"><code>__cpp_lib_starts_ends_with</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/20#cpp_lib_starts_ends_with_201711L\"><code>201711L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++20)</span></td>\n<td>String prefix and suffix checking: <span class=\"t-lc\">starts_with()</span> and <span class=\"t-lc\">ends_with()</span>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">literals</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> str <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Hello, C++20!\"</span>s<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a>\n    <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> str.<span class=\"me1\">starts_with</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"He\"</span>sv<span class=\"br0\">)</span>  <span class=\"co1\">// (1)</spa